<title>UK: SIBNEFT ADDS $25 MILLION TO THREE-YEAR FRN.</title>
<headline>SIBNEFT ADDS $25 MILLION TO THREE-YEAR FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to $150 million from $125 million , lead manager Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AO SIBERIAN OIL COMPANY (SIBNEFT)</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +400 BP   PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY NONE	ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   1.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   NONE	REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100+1     SALE LIMITS US/UK/RU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	REG S, TEFRA D, CAT 2, NO 144A</p>
<p>		ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 01.AUG FOR $125 MLN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
